flowchart TD
    RGB[RGB 224x224x3] --> RE[RGB ResNet-50]
    DEP[Depth 256x256x1] --> DE[Depth GN-ResNet-50]
    TXT[Instruction token ids] --> BI[50-d embedding + BiLSTM]
    PA[Previous action / START] --> AE[32-d action embedding]
    RE --> RF[RGB spatial features 2112x16]
    DE --> DF[Depth spatial features 192x16]
    RF --> RG[Global RGB 256]
    DF --> DG[Global Depth 128]
    RG --> G1[GRU-1: 416 to 512]
    DG --> G1
    AE --> G1
    M1[(Memory 1: 512)] --> G1
    G1 --> M1
    G1 --> TA[State queries instruction attention]
    BI --> TA
    TA --> VA[Attended instruction queries visual attention]
    RF --> VA
    DF --> VA
    VA --> FUSE[Fuse 1184 and compress to 512]
    G1 --> FUSE
    AE --> FUSE
    FUSE --> G2[GRU-2: 512 to 512]
    M2[(Memory 2: 512)] --> G2
    G2 --> M2
    G2 --> HEAD[Linear 512 to 4]
    HEAD --> ACTION[STOP / FORWARD / LEFT / RIGHT]
    ACTION -. next policy step .-> PA
